				"category": "cleaningrobot",
				"tags": [
					"Control"
				],
				"readmeComment": "Point and zone cleaning: write `target-point` or `zone-points` first, then send the start action. Custom cleaning uses the room settings saved with the Mi Home app. `start-fast-mapping` overwrites the saved map and needs the robot on the dock. Map editing, saved map selection, room split / merge / rename, schedules and voice pack download need several inputs and are not available. Value mapping `[\"start-sweep\"\u003d\"Start or resume cleaning\",\"pause\"\u003d\"Pause cleaning\",\"stop-sweeping\"\u003d\"Stop cleaning\",\"start-charge\"\u003d\"Return to dock\",\"stop-charge\"\u003d\"Stop returning to dock\",\"start-all-clean\"\u003d\"Start cleaning all rooms\",\"start-point-clean\"\u003d\"Start point cleaning\",\"pause-point-clean\"\u003d\"Pause point cleaning\",\"start-zone-clean\"\u003d\"Start zone cleaning\",\"pause-zone-clean\"\u003d\"Pause zone cleaning\",\"start-custom-clean\"\u003d\"Start custom cleaning\",\"find-device\"\u003d\"Locate the robot\",\"reset-side-brush\"\u003d\"Reset side brush life\",\"reset-main-brush\"\u003d\"Reset main brush life\",\"reset-dust-filter\"\u003d\"Reset dust box filter life\",\"reset-map\"\u003d\"Clear the saved map\",\"set-calibration\"\u003d\"Start level calibration\",\"set-new-map\"\u003d\"Create a new map\",\"start-fast-mapping\"\u003d\"Start quick mapping\"]`"
			},
